    "sections": {
        "description": "<h3>Slack Chat + AI Chatbot Agent Plugin for WordPress</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.socialintents.com/slack-live-chat.jsp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Slack Chat</a> by Social Intents helps you convert visitors, close deals, and support customers—all from inside <strong>Slack</strong>.</p>\n<p>Easily embed a ChatGPT-powered <strong>AI chatbot</strong> trained on your own website content. Let it handle pre-sales and support questions 24/7, then escalate the conversation to your human team via Slack when needed.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>No separate software. No learning curve. Just better customer support for your WordPress sites.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Add a Custom AI Agent Chatbot to your Website (in Minutes)\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MxrptyVPV2Q?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><strong>✨ Highlights:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Embed ChatGPT on your website—trained on your content in seconds<br />\n&#8211; Route conversations to live agents in your Slack channels<br />\n&#8211; Create custom agent actions to trigger workflows from the AI<br />\n&#8211; Fully customizable: match your brand, language, and tone<br />\n&#8211; Pick your AI model from ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini models</p>\n<p><strong>Secure, reliable, and easy to install. Try it free with a 14-day trial.</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.socialintents.com/signup.do\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Start your FREE trial today <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span></a></p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>One-click setup – no coding required  </li>\n<li>Escalate chatbot conversations to live Slack channels  </li>\n<li>Add ChatGPT to your website  </li>\n<li>Add Claude to your website </li>\n<li>Add Gemini to your website </li>\n<li>Train your chatbot using your website or knowledge base  </li>\n<li>Unlimited agents and monthly chat sessions on all plans  </li>\n<li>Pre-sales and contact forms (online/offline modes)  </li>\n<li>Slack-native interface with seamless integration  </li>\n<li>Mobile push, email, and desktop notifications  </li>\n<li>Custom chat widget branding, logos, and colors  </li>\n<li>Proactive chat triggers and scheduling options  </li>\n<li>Multilingual support and customizable messages  </li>\n<li>Full chat history, offline messages, and missed chats  </li>\n<li>Remove co-branding  </li>\n<li>Outstanding customer support</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To learn more, visit: <a href=\"https://www.socialintents.com/slack-live-chat.jsp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://www.socialintents.com/slack-live-chat.jsp</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Activate the plugin  </li>\n<li>Sign up for a free Social Intents trial  </li>\n<li>Enter your API Key and configure the Slack Chat widget  </li>\n<li>Start chatting from Slack or your web dashboard</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='do%20i%20need%20a%20social%20intents%20account%20to%20use%20slack%20chat%3F'>\nDo I need a Social Intents account to use Slack Chat?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can register for a 14-day free trial at <a href=\"https://www.socialintents.com/slack-live-chat.jsp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">socialintents.com</a>.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20this%20plugin%20without%20installing%20extra%20software%3F'>\nCan I use this plugin without installing extra software?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Slack Chat is cloud-based. No server-side installation required. Just paste your App Key and you&#8217;re live.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20this%20really%20native%20slack%20integration%3F'>\nIs this really native Slack integration?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You’ll receive and respond to chats directly inside your Slack workspace. No extra tools needed.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.2.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed XSS vulnerability with proper input sanitization</li>\n<li>WordPress 6.8.1 compatibility</li>\n<li>Updated plugin UI and documentation</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Add AI Chatbots and AI Agents backed by your team in Slack. Train ChatGPT on your content and escalate chats to your team in Slack.",
